@startuml CloudWarehouse_Roadmap_Phases
title Project Roadmap - Phase 1 (4-week MVP) + Phase 2 (ongoing)

skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #F8F9FA
  BorderColor #34495e
  FontSize 11
}

legend left
  |= Color |= Meaning |
  | <#90EE90> | Done |
  | <#ADD8E6> | In progress |
  | <#FFF2CC> | Planned |
endlegend

|Phase 1 - Sprint 1 (Week 1)|
start
#90EE90:M1 Foundation - ERD + schema.sql;
#90EE90:Sites / Destinations CRUD;

|Phase 1 - Sprint 2 (Week 2)|
#90EE90:M2 Excel import preview;
#90EE90:Standard + legacy 3-row headers;

|Phase 1 - Sprint 3 (Week 3)|
#90EE90:M3 PriceRules txn import;
#90EE90:Freight calculate API / UI;

|Phase 1 - Sprint 4 (Week 4)|
#90EE90:M4 Unit/integration tests + CI;
#90EE90:Coverage artefact + CodeQL;

|Phase 2 - Sprint 5+ (post mid-term to Aug)|
#90EE90:M6 Strategy billing (Tier / Overweight / Volumetric);
#90EE90:Dual-track waybill + historical price;
#90EE90:M6b Built-in rule RAG (lexical FAQ);
#90EE90:M6c PDA no-order reporting MVP;
#ADD8E6:M5 Final report + 7 assessment videos;
note right
  Phase 1 = 4-week MVP only.
  Phase 2 continues after mid-term
  (design depth + PDA); not "4 weeks total".
end note

|Later (Planned)|
#FFF2CC:M7 JWT / RBAC (ADR deferred);
#FFF2CC:M8 Microservice extraction (only if triggers met);

stop

@enduml
